flowchart TD
    U[User / API client] --> API[SmartDoc ASP.NET Core Web API]
    API --> VALIDATE[Validate upload and metadata]
    VALIDATE --> BLOB[Azure Blob Storage]
    VALIDATE --> SQLMETA[(SQL document metadata and status)]
    API --> SB[Azure Service Bus queue: document-processing]
    SB --> FUNC[Azure Function: DocumentProcessingFunction]
    FUNC --> LOOKUP[Load document metadata from SQL]
    LOOKUP --> DOWNLOAD[Download file from Blob Storage]
    DOWNLOAD --> EXTRACT[Extract document text]
    EXTRACT --> AI[Azure OpenAI: resume extraction / planned classification]
    AI --> RESULT[Validate and map result]
    RESULT --> SQLRESULT[(SQL: resume extraction result)]
    RESULT --> COMPLETE[Complete Service Bus message]
    FUNC -->|Retry on failure| SB
    SB --> DLQ[Dead-letter queue after delivery limit]
    SQLRESULT --> IDEMP[Idempotency: document ID check + unique constraint]
